<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13444" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπό-πληκτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποπλήσσω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
			<i>disabled by a stroke,</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b> in mind, <i>struck dumb,
				astounded,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.173
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				731
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ποδί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					248
				</span></i>
			; <i>senseless,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐχ οὕτως ἄφρων οὐδ᾽ ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					21.143
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				<u>Epit.</u>
				344
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Ir.</u>
				p.82
			</span></i> W., <i><span class="en">
				D.Chr.
				11.100
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. καὶ παντελῶς μαινόμενος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					34.16
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὃ νυνὶ ποεῖς ἀ. ἐστι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Men.
					<u>Pk.</u>
					246
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τότερος μῦθος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.Chr.
					11.54
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> in body,
				<i>paralysed, crippled,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.167
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.Com.
				130
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τὰς γνάθους</span>”
				<i>struck dumb,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>V.</u>
					948
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> Medic.,
				<i>stricken with paralysis,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Aph.</u>
				6.57
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέρος</span>”
				<i>paralysed,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Flat.</u>
					13
				</span></i>
			: so <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκέλος</span> Id. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>SD</u>
				1.7
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπόπληκτοι</span>”
				<i>cases of apoplexy,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Aph.</u>
					3.16
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
